sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Manager
  participant C as Console / phone
  participant AI as AI service
  participant M as Claude API
  participant T as Query tools
  participant D as PostgreSQL (RLS as user)
  U->>C: "Which site misses closing checks most, and on which days?"
  C->>AI: question + user session
  AI->>M: system prompt + tool definitions (cached) + question
  M-->>AI: tool_use: aggregate(metric=missed_runs, group_by=[site, weekday], kind=closing)
  AI->>T: validate params (strict schema)
  T->>D: parameterised query under user's RLS
  D-->>T: rows (+ record ids)
  T-->>AI: results
  AI->>M: tool_result
  M-->>AI: answer text + chart spec + cited record ids
  AI->>D: log ai_interactions (tools, citations, tokens)
  AI-->>C: answer, chart, clickable records
  U->>C: "Save as weekly report"
  C->>AI: save_query → saved_queries (schedule Mon 07:00)
